        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 27:2",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Of the children of Perez was the chief of all the captains of the host for the first month.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 25,
            "end": 28
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 27:3",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "And over the course of the second month was Dodai an Ahohite, and of his course was Mikloth also the ruler: in his course likewise were twenty and four thousand.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 40,
            "end": 43
          },
          {
            "start": 80,
            "end": 83
          },
          {
