        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 27:4",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "The third captain of the host for the third month was Benaiah the son of Jehoiada, a chief priest: and in his course were twenty and four thousand.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 50,
            "end": 53
          },
          {
            "start": 117,
            "end": 121
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 27:5",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "This is that Benaiah, who was mighty among the thirty, and above the thirty: and in his course was Ammizabad his son.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 13,
            "end": 20,
            "text": "2 Sam. 23:20 (20–23)."
