        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 27:17",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "Of Judah, Elihu, one of the brethren of David: of Issachar, Omri the son of Michael:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 17,
            "end": 20
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 27:18",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "Of Zebulun, Ishmaiah the son of Obadiah: of Naphtali, Jerimoth the son of Azriel:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 27:19",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "Of the children of Ephraim, Hoshea the son of Azaziah: of the half tribe of Manasseh, Joel the son of Pedaiah:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 27:20",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "Of the half tribe of Manasseh in Gilead, Iddo the son of Zechariah: of Benjamin, Jaasiel the son of Abner:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 17
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 27:21",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "Of Dan, Azareel the son of Jeroham. These were the princes of the tribes of Israel.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 42,
            "end": 46
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 27:22",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "But David took not the number of them from twenty years old and under: because the Lord had said he would increase Israel like to the stars of the heavens.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 134,
            "end": 139,
            "text": "Gen. 15:5; D&C 132:30 (30–31)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 23,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 27:23",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 23
      },
      {
